     "id": "where-it-is-used-1",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "t": "prose",
       "md": "- **Labor / human capital**: the present value of a college wage premium over a career — the return that drives education decisions behind relative supply in the [Canonical Model of the Skill Premium](note:canonical-model-of-the-skill-premium).\n- **Macro / finance**: discounting, multipliers, asset prices.\n- **Time series econometrics**: AR processes and serially correlated errors (a failure of the no-correlation assumption in [SR Assumptions](note:sr-assumptions))."
      }
     ],
